},{"title":"Marks","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Marks","line":30},{"title":"Enhancing the accessibility of a chart","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Enhancing-the-accessibility-of-a-chart","line":42},{"title":"Marks","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Marks","line":44},{"title":"Swift Charts","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Charts","line":46},{"title":"A bar chart that depicts the number of steps for each day in a month.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/69afb0247060876d7c148529bb6770ef/charts-bar-marks%402x.png","line":50,"embedded":true},{"title":"A line chart that depicts the performance of a stock over a five-year period.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a242ab0dd33e91b2928163ac76839aae/charts-line-marks%402x.png","line":54,"embedded":true},{"title":"A point-mark chart that depicts per-day readings of heartbeats per minute over a 5 1/2-month period.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e425cf9c73689456ffe358c15a2db34c/charts-point-marks%402x.png","line":58,"embedded":true},{"title":"Axes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Axes","line":62},{"title":"An illustration of Battery Settings, which uses a chart to depict battery charge over time, where the charge can vary within a fixed range from 0% to 100%.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/77814deac13d3c51e09eb47c57e690fa/charts-fixed-range-axis%402x.png","line":66,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of the Steps chart in the Health app, which shows the average number of steps per day for a single week.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ba6263f9c8e9b9afef93349f20cbdde7/charts-dynamic-range-axis-small%402x.png","line":70,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of the Steps chart in the Health app, which shows the average number of steps per day in a one-month period.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/de535d589204fce38a55acfb5c869c3e/charts-dynamic-range-axis-large%402x.png","line":72,"embedded":true},{"title":"Descriptive content","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Descriptive-content","line":80},{"title":"An illustration of the rain forecast for the next hour in the Weather app, which uses succinct, plain language to describe the expected precipitation.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/28ee38d191d2f9816ded3e735bfee4a7/charts-descriptive-content%402x.png","line":86,"embedded":true},{"title":"Best practices","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Best-practices","line":88},{"title":"Enhancing the accessibility of a chart","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Enhancing-the-accessibility-of-a-chart","line":94},{"title":"Audio graphs","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Accessibility/audio-graphs","line":94},{"title":"Vision","target":"https://www.apple.com/accessibility/vision/","line":94},{"title":"Accessibility","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/accessibility","line":100},{"title":"`accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(_:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/View/accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction\\(_:\\","line":100},{"title":"`NSAccessibility.Notification`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSAccessibility-swift.struct/Notification","line":102},{"title":"`UIAccessibility.Notification`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UIAccessibility/Notification","line":102},{"title":"Color","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Color","line":106},{"title":"Inclusive color","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/color#Inclusive-color","line":108},{"title":"An illustration of a blood pressure chart in the Health app that uses a red circle to represent systolic values and a black or white diamond to represent diastolic values.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/47d2a6b70d030b1aa595826248cb1186/charts-colors%402x.png","line":112,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of iPhone Storage Settings, which uses a single bar mark containing several segments of different colors to show the relative space taken by items such as music, apps, and photos. The bar includes a narrow strip of empty space between each pair of segments.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/86da90aecee27935b14e2b48388d08a6/charts-colors-stacked%402x.png","line":116,"embedded":true},{"title":"Enhancing the accessibility of a chart","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Enhancing-the-accessibility-of-a-chart","line":118},{"title":"Audio graphs","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Accessibility/audio-graphs","line":120},{"title":"An illustration of a chart in Maps that shows the range of elevations over the total distance of the trip. A VoiceOver focus indicator is visible on top of the chart, containing approximately one-fifth of the total distance and elevation.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b85d8add4c38b6bedd65caf24fdbe03a/charts-bar-chart-with-voiceover-focus%402x.png","line":130,"embedded":true},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Platform-considerations","line":149},{"title":"watchOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#watchOS","line":153},{"title":"Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Resources","line":157},{"title":"Related","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Related","line":159},{"title":"Charting data","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charting-data","line":161},{"title":"Developer documentation","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Developer-documentation","line":163},{"title":"Swift Charts","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Charts","line":165},{"title":"Videos","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Videos","line":167},{"title":"![","target":"https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/wwdc-services/images/3055294D-836B-4513-B7B0-0BC5666246B0/89D5888B-58DA-4F47-8E3C-998253F6BA98/9954_wide_250x141_1x.jpg","line":169},{"title":"![","target":"https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/wwdc-services/images/124/FA764D2D-4E15-4E91-91BA-BDAC80FB901B/6694_wide_250x141_1x.jpg","line":171},{"title":"![","target":"https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/wwdc-services/images/124/4BBCB61E-65ED-43FE-8F7B-81524E0C96BE/6692_wide_250x141_1x.jpg","line":173},{"title":"Change log","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Change-log","line":175}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ai stuff/antigravity-awesome-skills-main/plugins/antigravity-awesome-skills-claude/skills/hig-components-content/references/charts.md"},
